        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 52,
      "author": {
        "id": 1882526
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-06T13:26:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IMO, these functions (along with `psci`) should only act as a slim easy-to-use \"Rusty\" mean of issuing the SMCs/HVCs and should not add extra logic. MMIO_GUARD_MAP takes an IPA and, therefore, so does this function; if an address is passed that is not granule-aligned, the function should still issue the HVC (with the invalid argument) and pKVM is then responsible for rejecting it, resulting in a `Result::Err`.\n\nBTW, I treat this module as a staging area for what should be turned into a crate (see b/245889995) so would rather limit its dependencies; as an HVC64 takes `u64`s, I can\u0027t think of a better type to represent its parameter.",
      "parentUuid": "c2fe9cc1_60501fd2",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 52,
        "startChar": 22,
        "endLine": 52,
        "endChar": 31
      },
      "revId": "11ec227dd03f65d99ed864ecaa841e7f0f1af9bd",
